      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "过去优秀素质只顾着紧盯\n跑在同世代最前方的东海帝王。\n这是好事也是坏事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9186c0c5cbb19653a0701cdaac59c1e3c2a2d026639d617c7f7635d3c5d71c23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
